From d71f8dc6e9f8ec4f27d8c464a9ec7dc3981f7b3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Benjamin Tan <benjamin@dev.ofcr.se>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: git: fetch and import one raw ref

Code review systems expose commits through refs outside the branch and
tag namespaces. Some Git servers also let clients fetch a full commit ID

Add a one-shot fetch path for a raw ref or full commit ID. Import the
target as a visible head without creating a remote-tracking ref

Use a unique temporary ref for each fetch. This keeps concurrent fetches
independent and preserves any existing internal ref

Refs #4388

Co-authored-by: 4evy <git@evy.pink>

